@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@ticketCategoryId = 2
@showId = 1
@sessionId = 1
@orderId = replace-after-request-success

### 0.1 用户登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000001",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("userToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 0.2 管理员登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000002",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 1. 预热当前票档库存
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/ticket-categories/{{ticketCategoryId}}/stock/preheat
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. 默认 flash-sale 下先进入 Waiting Room
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/waiting-room/queue?ticketCategoryId={{ticketCategoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 3. 管理员放行队首用户并发放 admissionToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/ops/waiting-room/admission-batches?ticketCategoryId={{ticketCategoryId}}&count=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

> {%
  client.global.set("admissionToken", response.body.data[0].token);
%}

### 4. 用户查询 Waiting Room 状态；放行后 queued 应为 false
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/waiting-room/status?ticketCategoryId={{ticketCategoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 5. 获取一次性下单幂等 Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/idempotency-token
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

> {%
  client.global.set("idempotencyToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 6. 提交异步抢票
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/async
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{idempotencyToken}}",
  "admissionToken": "{{admissionToken}}"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("requestId", response.body.data.requestId);
%}

### 7. 查询异步请求结果
### 可能依次看到 PRE_DEDUCTED / QUEUED / PROCESSING，最终收敛到 SUCCESS、FAILED 或 COMPENSATED。
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/order-requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

> {%
  if (response.body.data && response.body.data.orderId) {
    client.global.set("orderId", response.body.data.orderId);
  }
%}

### 8. SUCCESS 后查询正式订单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 9. 查询当前用户订单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 10. 取消仍处于 PENDING_PAYMENT 的订单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 说明
### - POST /api/orders 已废弃，不进入当前样例。
### - POST /api/orders/{id}/pay 已废弃；支付流程见 payment.http。
### - admissionToken 与 idempotencyToken 都是一次性凭证，重复执行第 6 步前必须重新获取。
